# Leave EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL commented out when testing with Expo Go: the app then finds the API on the
# computer running `npx expo start` (http://<that computer's LAN IP>:4000/api).
# Set it only for a tunnel or a deployed API (must end in /api and use https for real builds):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-tunnel-or-host.example.com/api

